=20

I have material new information which came to light during the course of th=
e ten-day trial and immediately following the trial.=20

=20

I have uploaded a substantial amount of new material to the shared Box driv=
e and will be adding more documents over the next few days.

=20

As you know, Mr. Zahmoul is on the Board of Directors of Oxus Acquisition C=
orp. The SPAC completed its business combination with Borealis on 7th Februa=
ry 2024 and the new company was launched on Nasdaq under the ticker symbol B=
RLS. The majority owner and chairman of the board is Kenes Rakishev.

=20

The documents I uploaded include proprietary information, open-source infor=
mation, a timeline, and a power-point presentation.

=20

Mr. Zahmoul is involved in money laundering for Kenes Rakishev, not only th=
rough the SPAC but also through other special purpose vehicles. Mr. Zahmoul =
is potentially using his London-based financial firm, Emvirya Ltd, to facili=
tate investments on behalf of Rakishev, including cryptocurrency investments=
 through his institutional relationship with Forte Securities.

=20

Rakishev is acting as a proxy for Ramzan Kadyrov (Chechen leader, sanctione=
d) and for prominent Kazakh oligarchs.=20

Rakishev is a close friend of Hunter Biden and is cited in the House of Rep=
resentatives=E2=80=99s memorandum on the =E2=80=9CBiden Influence Peddling Schemes=E2=80=9D fo=
r making a payment of $142,300 to Hunter Biden for the purchase of a car.=20

=20

The information uploaded relates to the following matters:

-       OFAC Ukraine sanctions=20

-       Access to capital markets for sanctioned entities.

-       Money laundering on behalf of kleptocrats.

-       Interference with 2024 US elections.

=20

I have been advised to send the information to DOJ=E2=80=99s recently launched =E2=80=
=9CKleptoCapture Task Force=E2=80=9D and I was given two contact names.

=20

I also have a direct introduction to Hunter Biden through a very close frie=
nd. However, Monica has strongly recommended that I hold off and don=E2=80=99t do =
anything until I hear from you.

=20

I will continue to upload the new material over the next few days. Monica a=
nd I are available to speak at your convenience to discuss the new material.

=20

With my kind wishes,

Nadia

